---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>About Alessandro Paravano | Academic Profile & Space Economy Expertise</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Academic profile of Alessandro Paravano, Assistant Professor at Politecnico di Milano and Space Economy researcher: positions, teaching, honors and awards, and selected academic service and affiliations." />
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonicalUrl} />
  <meta property="og:type" content="profile" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="About Alessandro Paravano | Academic Profile & Space Economy Expertise" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Assistant Professor at Politecnico di Milano researching the Space Economy, complex infrastructures, ecosystems, value networks, systems architecting and project governance." />
  <meta property="og:url" content={canonicalUrl} />
  <meta property="profile:first_name" content="Alessandro" />
  <meta property="profile:last_name" content="Paravano" />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)}></script>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(profilePageSchema)}></script>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)}></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="container site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Alessandro Paravano</a>
      <div class="navlinks">
        <a href="/research/">Research</a>
        <a href="/publications/">Publications</a>
        <a href="/about/" aria-current="page">About</a>
        <a href="/media-contact/">Media &amp; Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="about-page about-page-v2">
    <section class="container about-v2-hero">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="about-v2-hero-intro">
        <p>Academic profile, current appointments, teaching, honors and awards, and selected academic service and affiliations.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="bio" class="about-v2-section">
      <div class="container about-v2-grid">
        <div class="about-v2-heading"><h2>Bio</h2></div>
        <div class="about-v2-content about-v2-prose">
          <p><strong>Alessandro Paravano</strong> is an Assistant Professor and Core Faculty member at the <strong>POLIMI School of Management, Politecnico di Milano</strong>, and a Senior Researcher with the <strong>Space Economy Observatory</strong>. His primary empirical domain is the <strong>Space Economy</strong>, where he studies how new technologies, private actors, markets and governance arrangements reshape <strong>industrial value chains</strong>, <strong>business ecosystems</strong> and the relationship between space infrastructure and end users.</p>
          <p>His research connects <strong>strategic project management</strong>, <strong>systems engineering</strong> and <strong>systems architecting</strong> to examine <strong>value and value networks</strong>, <strong>project ecosystems and ecologies</strong>, <strong>project governance</strong>, commercialization, resilience and long-term project success. Empirical areas include <strong>Earth Observation</strong>, <strong>GNSS and PNT</strong>, satellite communications, launchers, <strong>Commercial Space Stations</strong>, the <strong>LEO economy</strong>, <strong>in-space manufacturing</strong> and other <strong>complex infrastructures</strong>. He combines qualitative and quantitative methods and holds a PhD and MSc in Management Engineering from Politecnico di Milano with highest honours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="position" class="about-v2-section about-v2-section-soft">
      <div class="container about-v2-grid">
        <div class="about-v2-heading"><h2>Current position</h2></div>
        <div class="about-v2-content about-v4-position-list">
          <article>
            <h3>Assistant Professor, Politecnico di Milano</h3>
            <p>Department of Management, Economics and Industrial Engineering and POLIMI School of Management. Core Faculty.</p>
            <div class="about-v2-inline-links"><a href="https://www.som.polimi.it/en/faculty/paravano-alessandro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">School of Management profile ↗</a><a href="https://www.dig.polimi.it/en/staff/alessandro.paravano" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department profile ↗</a></div>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Senior Researcher, Space Economy Observatory</h3>
            <p>Research on space markets, industrial transition, value chains, satellite applications and the evolution of the Space Economy ecosystem.</p>
            <div class="about-v2-inline-links"><a href="https://eng.osservatori.net/space-economy-eng/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Space Economy Observatory ↗</a></div>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Lecturer, POLIMI Graduate School of Management</h3>
            <p>Executive education on the Space Economy and the aerospace sector.</p>
            <div class="about-v2-inline-links"><a href="https://www.gsom.polimi.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">POLIMI Graduate School of Management ↗</a></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="teaching" class="about-v2-section">
      <div class="container about-v2-grid">
        <div class="about-v2-heading"><h2>Teaching</h2></div>
        <div class="about-v2-content">
          <div class="about-v2-teaching-block">
            <h3>Current university teaching</h3>
            <div class="about-v2-teaching-list">
              <article><span>MSc</span><div><strong>Space Economy and Earth Observation Business</strong><p>Politecnico di Milano</p></div></article>
              <article><span>MSc</span><div><strong>Aerospace Project Management</strong><p>Politecnico di Milano</p></div></article>
            </div>
            <a class="about-v2-source-link" href="https://onlineservices.polimi.it/manifesti/manifesti/controller/ricerche/RicercaPerDocentiPublic.do?EVN_DIDATTICA=evento&aa=2026&k_doc=457597&lang=EN&tab_ricerca=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official POLIMI teaching record ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="about-v2-teaching-block">
            <h3>Executive education</h3>
            <div class="about-v2-teaching-list">
              <article><span>EMBA</span><div><strong>Space Economy EMBA module</strong><p>POLIMI Graduate School of Management</p></div></article>
              <article><span>EMBA</span><div><strong>Oklahoma EMBA study tour on the EU aerospace sector</strong><p>POLIMI Graduate School of Management</p></div></article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="awards" class="about-v2-section about-v2-section-soft">
      <div class="container about-v2-grid">
        <div class="about-v2-heading"><h2>Honors &amp; awards</h2></div>
        <div class="about-v2-content about-v2-awards">
          {awards.map((award) => (
            <article class="about-v2-award">
              <span class="about-v2-year">{award.year}</span>
              <div class="about-v2-award-line">
                <strong>{award.title}</strong>
                <span class="about-v2-award-org">{award.org}</span>
                {award.href && <a href={award.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={`Official source for ${award.title}`}>Official source ↗</a>}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="service" class="about-v2-section about-v2-selected-service-section">
      <div class="container about-v2-grid">
        <div class="about-v2-heading"><h2>Selected academic service &amp; affiliations</h2></div>
        <div class="about-v2-content about-v2-selected-service-list">
          {selectedService.map((item) => (
            <article class="about-v2-selected-service-row">
              <h3>{item.title}</h3>
              <p><a href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{item.org} ↗</a>{item.detail && <> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {item.detail}</>}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-v2-next">
      <div class="container about-v2-next-compact">
        <span class="about-v2-eyebrow">Explore</span>
        <a href="/research/">Research →</a>
        <a href="/publications/">Publications →</a>
        <a href="/media-contact/">Media &amp; Contact →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-top">
      <div class="footer-identity"><strong>Alessandro Paravano</strong><span>Assistant Professor, Politecnico di Milano</span><a href="mailto:alessandro.paravano@polimi.it">alessandro.paravano@polimi.it</a></div>
      <div class="footer-explore"><span class="footer-label">Navigation</span><a href="/research/">Research</a> · <a href="/publications/">Publications</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/media-contact/">Media &amp; Contact</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container footer-profiles">
      <span class="footer-label profiles-label">Profiles</span>
      <div class="profiles-grid">
        <div><h3>Institutional</h3><a href="https://www.dig.polimi.it/en/staff/alessandro.paravano" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Politecnico di Milano, DIG</a><a href="https://www.som.polimi.it/en/faculty/paravano-alessandro/" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">POLIMI School of Management</a><a href="https://re.public.polimi.it/cris/rp/rp111035" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">RE.PUBLIC@POLIMI</a></div>
        <div><h3>Academic profiles</h3><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?view_op=list_works&hl=it&user=ZLy7CJAAAAAJ" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Google Scholar</a><a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6884-3712" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">ORCID</a><a href="https://openalex.org/authors/A5004512386" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">OpenAlex</a><a href="https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/KUC-6564-2024" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Web of Science</a></div>
        <div class="profiles-continuation"><h3>Academic profiles continued</h3><a href="https://www.scopus.com/inward/authorDetails.url?authorID=58242859800&partnerID=MN8TOARS" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">Scopus</a><a href="https://authors.repec.org/pro/ppa1688/" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">RePEc</a><a href="https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/cf_dev/AbsByAuth.cfm?per_id=7685061" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">SSRN</a><a href="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Alessandro-Paravano" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">ResearchGate</a></div>
        <div><h3>Professional</h3><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alessandroparavano/" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a><a href="https://twitter.com/AleParavano" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">X / Twitter</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container footer-bottom">© {new Date().getFullYear()} Alessandro Paravano</div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
